{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并附施乳海水輪觀陀羅尼等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無可反，下同此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲呼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲呼，下同此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鞞揭反，下同此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "準施食須知及蜀本瑜伽、密教，皆云有甘露水呪出，實叉譯救面。然經後及撿藏本皆不載之，往往後來\n寫刻脫去矣。今謹依密教錄附經後，庶補其缺也。彼仍有乳海呪、一字水輪呪并偈句等，併以傳流。或有\n所用，則不為無考焉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捧水盂誦呪七徧洒之，下二呪亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲呼之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合\n三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "準大藏經音無犯切，下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
