{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寄歸傳亦云：復於行末，安食一盤，以供呵利帝母也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世言施水陸無主孤魂者，理出誘俗，言不涉教。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婆羅門及仙乃分二類，經文似悞也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不云及仙，此文似正。若作二類，婆羅門是人，不合同鬼施食也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二七為正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譯者不同，不須\n和會，據理但取飽滿為度。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方法訖，實叉譯云：於門內立展臂，戶外置盤淨地，不云瀉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當誦呪時，更加觀想。既為盡善，想器中飲食色\n味無盡，徧施不匱。如淨名室中一盂香飯，充足眾會，無所乏少。亦如涅槃純陀少飯，充滿雙林大眾，不多不少。\n信此陀羅尼不可思議，飲食色香亦不可思議，眾生心亦不可思議。夫何惑哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五果者，色、力、辯、安、壽。二嚴者，福、惠也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壽也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二嚴也。前五果中已有壽命，理無重出。信知此中以慧為命，五果、二嚴在文炳然若\n此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說，破餓鬼障"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引，四誦七徧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言已，彈指七下，行無畏施，然後以食瀉淨地上，想諸鬼神食之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答崔育材職方所問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經兩譯：一、實叉難陀譯，名救面然；二、不空譯，名救拔焰口"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不空譯呪後，令稱四如來名。實叉譯則無\n而有。施水呪名甘露陀羅尼，當取水一掬，亦誦呪七徧，散於空中。其水一滴，變成十斛甘露。一切餓鬼，悉得飽\n滿。兩經呪詞併列之。然霅川此文列二呪。今此施食，通覽既引二經，於前諸呪已具，故於此中略去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今出生飯者是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今之施斛者是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寄歸傳云：西方施主請僧齋日，初置聖僧供，次行僧食。復於行末安食一\n盤，以供呵利帝母。據此，不須人人各自出生。今順此土常儀，故各出生也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即金山寺舊名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出救面然餓鬼經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊鍔云：梁武齋儀相應者，則有華嚴經、寶積經、涅槃經、大明神呪經、大圓覺經、十輪經、佛頂經、\n面然經、施甘露水經、蘇悉地經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是東川楊鍔水陸儀所載。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊鍔儀文，祇有召請名銜，至各及眷屬，自餘以餘文補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辟，必益切，君也。\n褥，而蜀切，氈也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "澱音殿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󱕃音戶取魚器"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刺，七逆切。剚，側吏切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云\n云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見夷堅志"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言一切，則全收六道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楚宜反，不齊也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殺生\n命，祭邪鬼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右數節文，考閱之次，錄附于此。更有施食念誦祕軌，若欲修者，須從師受。凡諸真言神呪，亦未經師受而\n\n誦，則越諸佛三昧耶，可慎也夫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《漢語大詞典》第3冊第466頁"}
